Sleep 500ms
Type "jj"
Sleep 400ms
Space
Sleep 600ms
Type "l"
Sleep 1.8s
Type "h"
Sleep 700ms
Set TypingSpeed 90ms
Type "jjjjjjjjj"
Set TypingSpeed 70ms
Sleep 500ms
Type "l"
Sleep 2.8s
Set TypingSpeed 120ms
Type "jjjjjjjjjjjj"
Set TypingSpeed 70ms
Sleep 1.2s
